14. Membership Ownership

Every Chama-specific financial record must ultimately be traceable to:

Membership

For example:

Membership NUCSA001
      │
      ├── Contribution
      ├── Share
      ├── Loan
      ├── Loan Repayment
      └── Payout

This is the central ownership rule of ChamaCore.

