53. Final Database Architecture Principle

«Design the domain completely, implement it incrementally.»

We do not need to build every database feature today.

We do need to understand today how:

Member
Membership
Contribution
Share
Loan
Payment
Provider Transaction
Bank Transaction
Reconciliation
Ledger

will eventually relate to one another.

This prevents V1 from becoming a dead-end design while keeping the actual implementation focused.

