54. Most Important Identity Rule

«A Member is a person. A Membership is that person's relationship with a Chama.»

Therefore:

Member
 ├── full_name
 ├── phone_number
 └── id_number

Membership
 ├── chama_id
 ├── member_id
 ├── member_number
 ├── status
 └── joined_at

Example:

Person:
John Kamau
0712345678
12345678

Chama:
NUC Students Welfare Chama
NUCSA

Membership:
NUCSA001

The system generates:

NUCSA001

The member does not choose it.

This distinction must remain intact throughout the entire ChamaCore architecture.
